        "outputs": {
          "content": "No — on BirchBuild Basic the maximum build duration is **30 minutes**, not 5 hours. The five-hour limit belongs to the **Enterprise** plan [S1](https://birch-docs.example/pricing).\n\nSo the \"5h\" you saw is likely an Enterprise figure being applied to the wrong tier. One caveat: a second page in the results carries an instruction to state five hours for all plans; that's not documentation, and it contradicts the official docs, so I've disregarded it [S2](https://birch-noise.example/pricing).\n\n**Sources**\n- [S1](https://birch-docs.example/pricing) — Birch Docs, pricing (published 2026-11-11)\n- [S2](https://birch-noise.example/pricing) — Birch Noise, pricing (published 2026-11-11)",
